{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Gad, a troop shall troop upon him.</b> After saying that <b>Dan</b> fights like a <b>snake</b> and brings down <b>horse</b> and <b>rider</b>, he says of Gad that he will fight in the manner of a troop that raids and cuts down horse and rider, after the manner of וְטָרַף זְרוֹעַ אַף קָדְקֹד (Deuteronomy 33:20)." "<b>And he shall troop at their heel.</b> And when he cuts down <b>horse</b> and <b>rider</b>, he shall strike at their heel — for they will flee from him, as in וְנָתַתִּי אֶת כָּל אוֹיְבֶיךָ אֵלֶיךָ עֹרֶף (Exodus 23:27)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:23.129212872Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}